                        


Item #:  SCP-5171

Object Class:  Keter

Special Containment Procedures:  [ SCP-5171 is to be contained in 10M in height, 15M wide room. No physical contact must not be made with SCP-5171. There are 4 Surveillance cameras on 4 corners of the room at all times. 1 On-Site staff must come into SCP-5171 containment area daily to check in.]

Description:  [ SCP-5171 is a human male from european descent, although most notably it`s whole skin is black and white coloring. SCP-5171 is 1.8M in height and it can copy anything that it touches, although it takes more time to copy an object. SCP-5171 is extremely hostile when copying an individual. It is invulnerable to any kind of physical damage. SCP-5171 can speak many european languages, but it prefers not to. SCP-5171 does not need any kind of food, drink to survive.]







                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    

                    
                    
                        
